  "copy": {
    "fr": {
      "tagline": "Vingt pilotes s'affrontent dans une course arcade au parfum de Battle Royale. Esquive pièges et rivaux. Choisis entre vitesse ou sécurité.",
      "tags": [
        "Arcade",
        "Battle Royale",
        "Rapide"
      ]
    },
    "en": {
      "tagline": "Twenty pilots fight through an arcade race with a light touch of battle royale. Dodge the traps and your rivals, and choose speed or safety.",
      "tags": [
        "Arcade",
        "Battle royale",
        "Fast"
      ]
    }
  },
  "description": "Twenty pilots launch onto a bending neon highway and five of them reach the flag. You start last. Hold the left or right of the screen to lean, and climb the board by physically overtaking the craft ahead — mines, barriers and the pilots you clip all come off a shield that nothing else refills. Every so often the tarmac forks, and the two things you need are never on the same branch: charge on the slow line, boosters and mines on the fast one. A line across the tarmac marks each cut, green while you are inside the rank it asks for and red while you are not; cross one and the field is really trimmed — 15 pilots left, then 10, then 5 — until the chequered arch at 1020m.",
